{"term": "мохнатка", "lang": "ru", "script": "cyrl", "romanization": "mokhnatka", "category": "organs", "subcategory": "vagina", "concept": "vagina", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "slang_crude", "crude": 55, "technical": 3, "recognition_pct_current": 70, "recognition_pct_peak": 70, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "Literally 'hairy one' or 'fuzzy one'; a playful-crude slang term for the vagina/vulva that draws attention to pubic hair, implying an unshaved natural state.", "english_term": "bush", "english_translation_quality": "approximate", "notes": "Derived from мохнатый ('hairy,' 'shaggy'); the pubic hair reference is culturally specific and implies a naturalistic framing; the word is mildly humorous rather than aggressively crude; recognition may skew lower among younger cohorts given changing grooming norms that have reduced the cultural salience of the image."}
